// RUN: annc-asm %s -atir-op-fusion-v2 | FileCheck %s
//
// kp_sparse_dynamic_stitch 1:N carrier form: on static shapes the FE
// expands tf.Unique/tf.DynamicPartition into stablehlo semantic groups
// while the stitch anchor stays residue (real FE artifact, unmodified).
